    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Foxyball Development Blueprint</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small, independent studio of 4\u00a0passionate\u00a0developers, we are proud to present this debut\u00a0version of FOXYBALL\u00a0on STEAM.\u00a0Looking ahead, we remain dedicated to enhancing the gameplay experience through <strong>sustained free updates</strong>, as well as we are excited to continue our work on future development, including an <strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</strong>\u00a0version and a <strong>BODY-MOTION</strong>\u00a0version,\u00a0which we believe will offer the most immersive FOXYBALL experience yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we are actively exploring the possibility of bringing Foxyball to multi-platforms, such as the Switch 2 and Apple Glasses. We will do our best to serve our players by creating experiences that offer more dynamic, immersive, and entertaining gameplay, along with even more engaging and humorous interactions with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are game creators, and players, too! We firmly believe that the true value of games lies in offering relief and escape from the exhaustion and pressures of daily life\u2014not in burdening players with repetitive, time-consuming tasks. Our goal is to create an experience where players can carve out a little space away from the stresses of work and life, returning to the pure, unfiltered joy of gaming\u2014fun in its truest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our game resonates with you, or if you have any feedback or suggestions, we\u00a0would be most grateful if you followed us on Twitter/X: <strong>@HayenGames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we are grateful if you could support<strong>\u00a0&quot;Body-Motion Foxyball&quot;</strong> development by searching <strong>Foxyball</strong> on <strong>KICKSTARTER</strong> and back us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you sincerely for your interest and support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOXYBALL</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Boutique Leisure Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257630/extras/99ce0ee39f4bfc28012989982e521406.avif?t=1741079375\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOXYBALL is a <strong>fun and easy-to-play game</strong> inspired by Football Penalty. Instead of\u00a0playing against\u00a0a goalkeeper, the goal is divided into 24 blocks, with a new random configuration for each attempt. To score, players will need a combination of luck, skill, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created FOXYBALL to be a <strong>simple, relaxing experience\u2014quick to learn, easy to play, and perfect for unwinding</strong>.\u00a0It recaptures the charm and joy of the games we grew up with\u00a0back\u00a0in the 1990s and early 2000s,\u00a0where players could jump right in and start having fun. Also Foxyball is the game introduces your children to the joys of both football and gaming, brings fun and laughter to family time, or shares sweet, playful moments with your mates or loved one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Note:</u> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We realized that the atmosphere in the gameplay are somewhat underwhelming, we are committed to improving the player experience and will continue to release <strong>free major updates</strong> to address these shortcomings. We kindly ask for your patience as this is part of a long-term vision. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for your trust and support!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOXYBALL</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Boutique Leisure Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257630/extras/99ce0ee39f4bfc28012989982e521406.avif?t=1741079375\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOXYBALL is a <strong>fun and easy-to-play game</strong> inspired by Football Penalty. Instead of\u00a0playing against\u00a0a goalkeeper, the goal is divided into 24 blocks, with a new random configuration for each attempt. To score, players will need a combination of luck, skill, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created FOXYBALL to be a <strong>simple, relaxing experience\u2014quick to learn, easy to play, and perfect for unwinding</strong>.\u00a0It recaptures the charm and joy of the games we grew up with\u00a0back\u00a0in the 1990s and early 2000s,\u00a0where players could jump right in and start having fun. Also Foxyball is the game introduces your children to the joys of both football and gaming, brings fun and laughter to family time, or shares sweet, playful moments with your mates or loved one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Note:</u> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We realized that the atmosphere in the gameplay are somewhat underwhelming, we are committed to improving the player experience and will continue to release <strong>free major updates</strong> to address these shortcomings. We kindly ask for your patience as this is part of a long-term vision. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for your trust and support!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Use Your Football Skills, Spells and Strategy to Challenge the Random, Tricky and Funny Goals.",
